# Text files are LF in every working tree, whatever the system's setting: the guest's shell scripts, the golden files the tests compare
# byte for byte, go.sum and the sources all depend on it (a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn them into CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.gz binary
*.ico binary
*.qcow2 binary
